---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'; import FactBoundary from '../../components/FactBoundary.astro';
---
<Layout title="心事成字｜先听后写｜小民艺术" description="提交你的心事与场景，了解小民艺术的先听后写定制流程与隐私边界。"><section class="container page-head"><span class="eyebrow">Your story in ink / 心事成字</span><h1 class="serif">在写之前，<br/>先听你说。</h1><p>我们不从一个商品规格开始，而从你想写给谁、为什么写开始。</p></section><section class="container steps"><div class="step"><span class="mono">01</span><h2 class="serif">选择一个祝愿</h2><p>从福、禄、寿、喜、财里，找到最接近当下的一笔。</p></div><div class="step"><span class="mono">02</span><h2 class="serif">提交你的心事</h2><p>写给谁、什么场景、哪些话不想出现，都可以告诉我们。</p></div><div class="step"><span class="mono">03</span><h2 class="serif">内容二次确认</h2><p>姓名、日期、专名和隐私范围，会与你再次确认。</p></div><div class="step"><span class="mono">04</span><h2 class="serif">留下创作记录</h2><p>编号、视频与故事卡是否提供，以真实能力为准。</p></div><div class="step"><span class="mono">05</span><h2 class="serif">回到你的日常</h2><p>作品成为一段关系的纪念，也可以只属于你。</p></div></section><section class="container section story-form"><div><span class="eyebrow">A quiet form / 登记入口</span><h2 class="serif">先留下线索，<br/>不代表订单成立。</h2><p>你可以先通过邮件告诉我们场景，我们会在 1–2 个工作日内回复并说明下一步沟通方式。</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:hello@xiaominart.com?subject=心事成字预约登记">发送邮件登记 <span>→</span></a></div><FactBoundary /></section></Layout>
<style>.page-head{padding:96px 0 72px}.page-head h1{font-size:clamp(52px,7vw,84px);line-height:1.1;margin:20px 0}.page-head p{color:var(--muted);font-size:17px}.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.step{padding:20px 16px 28px 0}.step+.step{border-left:1px solid var(--border);padding-left:16px}.step .mono{color:var(--accent)}.step h2{font-size:25px;margin:28px 0 10px}.step p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}.story-form{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:72px;align-items:end}.story-form h2{font-size:40px;margin:18px 0}.story-form p{color:var(--muted);max-width:520px}@media(max-width:767px){.page-head{padding:56px 0 40px}.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}.step,.step+.step{padding:18px 0;border-left:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.step:last-child{border-bottom:0}.step h2{margin:8px 0}.story-form{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}}
</style>
